less it's cut by billions of euros. Follow DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: COVID vaccine maker BioNTech to close 3 sites</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:12c8c6479f5598d9c983e5dd8abc19634531eb342213f370c94b8450df005595</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:54:10Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T14:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-covid-vaccine-maker-biontech-to-close-3-sites/live-79453904--006a9a717608.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-covid-vaccine-maker-biontech-to-close-3-sites/live-79453904?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">COVID-19 vaccine maker BioNTech is to close three sites in Germany after efforts to find buyers failed. Meanwhile, Rhine water levels have fallen to record lows after an unusually dry September. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Two people killed as bus crashes on way to Oktoberfest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0d2f97392a31e7b258db78d4e9bf3cf3d05e436fa2e7bdad27e77a56d7633cf7</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:54:10Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T15:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/two-people-killed-as-bus-crashes-on-way-to-oktoberfest/a-79450016--d10b8bca83ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/two-people-killed-as-bus-crashes-on-way-to-oktoberfest/a-79450016?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The bus was traveling from Italy to Munich, carrying 33 Filipino tourists who wanted to visit the famous beer festival. One of the dozens injured remains in life-threatening condition.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Will Jürgen Klopp's charisma be enough for Germany?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7e38fd3450f10f09cae38bb7c84b1aca38563e106420864aec12dbed1fbc906</id><updated>2026-09-29T14:54:10Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T09:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternat